# Snake Game

A browser-based Snake Game built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features
- Smooth snake movement
- Collision detection
- Responsive UI
- Keyboard controls

## Tech Stack
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Live Demo
[Play Here](https://snake-game-tushar.netlify.app/)

